					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12443318#post-4343619</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12443318/scp-4445-ex#post-4343619</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2019 09:14:38 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Mafiew</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2035452</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Even though I love explained SCPs, especially the ones that turn out to be natural (non-anomalous) phenomenons, I'm a bit disappointed by this one.</p> <p>I think it lacks the explanation/story about how the Foundation was able to explain it in the end and why they were not able to do so right away.</p> <p>And if no part of it is anomalous, why keeping its existence a secret?</p> <p>Great tone and writing though.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
