					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This has been in the pipeline for over a year now. I'm always fascinated by fossils, and the concept that there's so much we can never know because soft tissue almost never fossilizes.</p> <p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4483018&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1567022641" alt="TheMightyMcB" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4483018)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" >TheMightyMcB</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1567022641" alt="MaliceAforethought" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" >MaliceAforethought</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/radioactiverads" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5053587&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1567022641" alt="RadioactiveRADS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5053587)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/radioactiverads" >RadioactiveRADS</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1567022641" alt="FloppyPhoenix" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" >FloppyPhoenix</a></span> for their input. Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xilascrowe" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2969291&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1567022641" alt="XilasCrowe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2969291)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xilascrowe" >XilasCrowe</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sepiafishie" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3387493&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1567022641" alt="sepiafishie" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3387493)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sepiafishie" >sepiafishie</a></span> for their witting and unwitting inspiration and motivation.</p> <p>Picture is CC 4.0, source here: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tuojiangosaurus_multispinus.003_-_Natural_History_Museum_of_London.JPG">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tuojiangosaurus_multispinus.003_-_Natural_History_Museum_of_London.JPG</a></p> 
